Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:24.50,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.55,0:01:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是「王子」的马厩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is where the Prince is stabled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.56,0:01:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 罗伯特爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Sir Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.65,0:01:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉打扰你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to disturb you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.64,0:01:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是乔伊·巴恩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Joe Barnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.22,0:01:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乔赛亚的儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Josiah's boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.10,0:01:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道他是谁 梅森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who he is, Mason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.25,0:01:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在这儿干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.89,0:01:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他对赛马很感兴趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's keen to race horses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.68,0:01:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会骑马 罗伯特爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can ride, Sir Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想要做骑师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd love to be a jockey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.03,0:01:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.68,0:01:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}超过任何愿望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than anything in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.31,0:01:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 很好 非常好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's good, very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.23,0:01:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这跟我有什么关系？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what has it got to do with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.98,0:01:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我可以为你工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I thought I could work for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.33,0:01:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经有足够的骑师了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have all the jockeys I need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.71,0:01:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请给我一次机会吧 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please give me a chance, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.80,0:01:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以清理马厩的垃圾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll muck out the stables, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.51,0:01:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}清扫马场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}clean the yard, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.08,0:01:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}随您吩咐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}anything you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.07,0:01:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我考虑一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll think about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.78,0:01:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢您 罗伯特爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Sir Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.01,0:01:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生 您最好赶紧回屋一趟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, at the house, you better come quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.28,0:01:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.08,0:01:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有麻烦了 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's trouble, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.17,0:02:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉过你比阿特丽斯夫人不舒服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you Lady Beatrice is unwell{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.34,0:02:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不想被打扰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and does not wish to be disturbed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.04,0:02:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我会成为她的特例{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she'll make an exception in my case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.95,0:02:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.56,0:02:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我接到严格的指示{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have strict instructions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.19,0:02:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是让我跟比阿特丽斯夫人谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you going to let me speak to Lady Beatrice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.26,0:02:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是逼我使用暴力？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or will I have to use force?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.80,0:02:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得先过我这关 布鲁尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll answer to me first, Brewer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.69,0:02:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这位先生坚持{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This gentleman is most insistent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.68,0:02:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要与夫人谈话 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}upon speaking to her ladyship, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.08,0:02:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我警告过你永远不要到这儿来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I warned you never to come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.19,0:02:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的事可以在你的办公室谈 不是这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our business can be discussed at your office, not here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.92,0:02:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在很多场合试图解决这个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've tried to settle this matter on many occasions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.87,0:02:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你该知道的 罗伯特爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you well know, Sir Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.63,0:02:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想不到在纽马基特发生那事之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a nerve coming here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.64,0:02:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你居然还有胆子来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}after New Market.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.05,0:02:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这次我有把握{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm leaving nothing to chance this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.26,0:02:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许比阿特丽斯夫人更乐于{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps Lady Beatrice will be more prepared{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.71,0:02:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听听理由{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to listen to reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.82,0:02:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是你我之间的恩怨 布鲁尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your grievance is with me, Brewer, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.37,0:02:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与他人无关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and with no one else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.50,0:03:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这当然与比阿特丽斯夫人有关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would certainly be of concern to Lady Beatrice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.74,0:03:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伯特 这些人是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robert, who are these people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.03,0:03:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们要干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what do they want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.88,0:03:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来告诉你我要干什么 比阿特丽斯夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what I want, Lady Beatrice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.34,0:03:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请他出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.07,0:03:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要要回自己的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want what's rightfully mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.91,0:03:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.11,0:03:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}滚 趁你两条腿还能走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go while you can still walk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.20,0:03:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会再来的 比阿特丽斯夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back, Lady Beatrice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.77,0:03:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good day to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.63,0:03:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉让你烦心 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry you've been upset, my dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.63,0:03:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是什么意思 罗伯特？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he mean, Robert, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.63,0:03:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么是本应属于他的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's rightfully his?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.75,0:03:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么可担心的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing for you to worry about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.81,0:03:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我的确很担心 罗伯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I do worry, Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.72,0:03:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我太了解你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you too well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.75,0:04:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不会再来烦我们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't bother us again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.66,0:04:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果他真的再来我们该怎么办 先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What should we do if he does come back, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.62,0:04:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果他再来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he does come back, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.13,0:04:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会亲自处理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll deal with him myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.49,0:04:49.08,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《肖斯科姆别墅》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.13,0:05:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 你懂赛马吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson, do you know a bit of racing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.62,0:05:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}照理说应该懂一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ought to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.80,0:05:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的负伤抚恤金有一半都花在了这上面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I paid for it with about half my wound pension.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.28,0:05:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我要把你当作我的「赛马指南」了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll give you my handy guide to the turf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.03,0:05:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.92,0:05:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你记得罗伯特·诺伯顿这个名字吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does the name Sir Robert Norberton recall anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.11,0:05:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.88,0:05:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的马驹参加了冠军锦标赛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got a horse running in the Champion Stakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他住在肖斯科姆庄园{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lives at Shoscombe Hall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.87,0:05:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的马厩在当地 被称为肖斯科姆别墅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His stables are known locally as Shoscombe Old Place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你并不认识他本人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you don't know the man himself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.18,0:05:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从没见过他 如果你是这个意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never met him if that's what you mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.21,0:05:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是出了名的危险人物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has a reputation of being rather a dangerous man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.39,0:05:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么个危险法？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dangerous?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.61,0:05:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我记得数月前有一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember an instance some months ago{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.35,0:05:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在纽马基特 希思用马鞭抽了一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he horsewhipped a man on New Market Heath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.62,0:05:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是塞缪尔 布鲁尔 卡森街的一位放债人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samuel Brewer, the Carson Street moneylender.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.72,0:05:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么会发生这样的攻击事件？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was the reason for this assault?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.64,0:05:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜是罗伯特爵士忌恨债主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I imagine that Sir Robert had a grudge against moneylenders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.82,0:06:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也就是说他负债累累{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or is heavily in their debt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.35,0:06:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据说 他目前是日陷窘境{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, by all accounts, he's so far down Queer Street, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.34,0:06:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能再也不能恢复往日风光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he may never find his way back again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.93,0:06:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我收到了约翰 梅森的信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I received a letter from John Mason, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.02,0:06:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是肖斯科姆的首席训练师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the head trainer at Shoscombe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.01,0:06:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}信是一小时前寄到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It arrived an hour ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.04,0:06:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.65,0:06:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您一定已经得知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will no doubt have read{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.04,0:06:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}塞缪尔 布鲁尔在几天前失踪的消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the disappearance a number of days ago of Samuel Brewer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.42,0:06:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了我的雇主罗伯特 诺伯顿爵士的利益{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the interests of my employer, Sir Robert Norberton, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.00,0:06:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想拜访您{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should like to visit you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.09,0:06:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来商谈一件十万火急的事件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to discuss a matter of the utmost urgency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.39,0:06:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不是约了时间嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He suggests a convenient time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.97,0:06:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经晚了几分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And already is several minutes late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.66,0:06:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}塞缪尔 布鲁尔失踪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samuel Brewer's disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.03,0:06:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}报纸已经大肆报道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The newspapers make a lot of it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.93,0:06:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们还是先来说说肖斯科姆吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but let's hear more about Shoscombe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.39,0:06:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肖斯科姆犬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the Shoscombe spaniels, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.46,0:06:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是肖斯科姆别墅女主人的骄傲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}special pride of the lady of Shoscombe Place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.22,0:06:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是罗伯特 诺伯顿的妻子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wife of Sir Robert Norberton I presume.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.26,0:06:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 他没结过婚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, He never married.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.66,0:06:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他和他的姐姐 一位遗孀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lives with his widowed sister, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.72,0:06:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比阿特丽斯 福德夫人住在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Beatrice Folder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.23,0:06:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是说 她寄住在他那里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean she lives with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.57,0:06:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 房子属于她的前夫 詹姆斯爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, the place belonged to her late husband, Sir James.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.32,0:06:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肖斯科姆会出什么事呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What should be amiss at Shoscombe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.41,0:06:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到底是怎么回事呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What indeed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.70,0:07:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望门外那位能够告诉我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here I expect is the man who can tell us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.70,0:07:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请进{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.64,0:07:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的蛋煮老了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My eggs were hard boiled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.82,0:07:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有一位梅森先生想要见您 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a Mr. Mason to see you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.45,0:07:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 哈德森女士 请他进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Mrs. Hudson, show him in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.98,0:07:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.17,0:07:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这边请{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'll come this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.79,0:07:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 福尔摩斯先生 您收到我的信了吗？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got my note, Mr. Holmes? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.31,0:07:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但里面什么都没说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it explained nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.43,0:07:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要把细节都付诸文字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was too delicate a thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.93,0:07:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实在太难下手了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for me to put the details on paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.77,0:07:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事情太复杂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was too complicated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.00,0:07:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可以信任我的朋友兼同事 华生医生的谨言慎行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may rely on the discretion of my friend and colleague, Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.90,0:07:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 请坐 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please sit down. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.64,0:07:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.16,0:07:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想罗伯特 诺伯顿爵士是疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Sir Robert Norberton has gone mad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.84,0:07:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜托 这里是贝克街 不是哈利街{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, this is Baker Street not Harley Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.21,0:07:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么这么说？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you say so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.33,0:07:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想是「肖斯科姆王子」和冠军锦标赛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe Shoscombe Prince and the Champion Stakes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.08,0:08:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把他弄成这样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}have turned his brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.32,0:08:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「肖斯科姆王子」？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Shoscombe Prince"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.09,0:08:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 你真是无价之宝 一匹吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson, you're invaluable. A horse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.72,0:08:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全英格兰最好的马 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The finest in England, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.53,0:08:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实上 罗伯特爵士必须赢得比赛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth is Sir Robert has got to win this race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.89,0:08:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他已经无路可走 这是最后的机会了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's up to his neck, and it's his last chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.16,0:08:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他把所有能够筹集的财产都押在了这匹马上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's wagered everything he could raise or borrow on the horse, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.20,0:08:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他把所有欠款{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's holding off his creditors{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.67,0:08:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都拖延到大赛之后归还{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}till after the big race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.55,0:08:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果「王子」输掉了比赛 他就完蛋了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, if the Prince fails him, he's done for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.01,0:08:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是猜测罗伯特爵士的债务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're assuming there's a connection between Sir Robert's debts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.19,0:08:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与塞缪尔 布鲁尔的失踪之间有关联{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the disappearance of Samuel Brewer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.12,0:08:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是罗伯特爵士的主要债权人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's Sir Robert's principal creditor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.77,0:08:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且我得指出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I don't mind admitting{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.38,0:08:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们之间没有任何好感{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's no love lost between them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.84,0:08:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在纽马基特的事情发生之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, after what happened at New Market{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.90,0:08:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一点也不惊讶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not surprised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.50,0:08:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但那仅仅是开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that was just the start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.46,0:08:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布鲁尔上周在庄园露面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brewer showed his face at the hall last week, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.54,0:08:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伯特爵士像疯了一样朝他发飙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Sir Robert flew at him like a man possessed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.30,0:08:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说如果他再出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said he'd deal with him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.87,0:08:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他会亲自收拾他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he ever showed his face there again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.45,0:08:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想他再也没回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I presume he has not returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.99,0:08:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.08,0:08:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.83,0:09:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}了解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.21,0:09:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果财产危机真的发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the event of financial catastrophe, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.31,0:09:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伯特爵士有权主张他姐姐的地产吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}would Sir Robert have any claim on his sister's estate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.22,0:09:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据我所知不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}None at all as far as I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.13,0:09:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她只有非世袭的财产所有权{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She only has a life interest in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.98,0:09:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在她死后 地产将归她丈夫的兄弟所有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It reverts to her husband's brother after her death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.81,0:09:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the meantime, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.78,0:09:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她能以夫人的身份收取年租{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}her ladyship draws the rents every year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.55,0:09:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而钱都被她弟弟花掉了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And her brother spends them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.75,0:09:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}差不多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's about the size of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.70,0:09:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的生活一定很坎坷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must lead a most uneasy life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.32,0:09:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许吧 但他们一直是挚友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe so, but they've always been the best of friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.38,0:09:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们志同道合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have the same tastes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.52,0:09:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她跟他一样热爱赛马{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She loves the horses as much as he does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.56,0:09:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少曾经是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or at least she did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.23,0:09:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以前每天12点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every day at about 12:00{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.55,0:09:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她都要驱车去马厩看马{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}she'd ride down to the stables to see them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.86,0:09:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尤其是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And above all, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.20,0:09:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她十分喜爱「王子」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}she loved the Prince.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.32,0:09:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早上好 比阿特丽斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Beatrice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.52,0:10:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我等不及想看看当这个讨喜的小家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't wait to see their faces{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.13,0:10:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第一个冲过终点柱的时候 他们会是什么表情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when this delightful creature is first past the post.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.63,0:10:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么说 梅森？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What say you, Mason?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.62,0:10:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其它马不会有胜算 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The others won't stand a chance, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.82,0:10:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赢它们三个身长 你说呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A three-length win, wouldn't you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.40,0:10:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}三个半身长 至少{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three and a half, at least.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.08,0:10:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是不要期望太高 罗伯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just beware of raising your hopes too high, Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.17,0:10:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不是唯一一个想让自己的赛马{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the only one who'd like to see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.08,0:10:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在冠军锦标赛上夺冠的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}his horse win the Champion Stakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.79,0:10:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我是唯一一个拥有 「肖斯科姆王子」的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the only one with a horse like Shoscombe Prince.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.60,0:10:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它的状态怎么这么好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why he's on such good form, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.14,0:10:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你甚至可以亲自骑着它去夺冠 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could ride him to victory yourself, my dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.25,0:10:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想不行了 罗伯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think not, Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.26,0:10:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们骑马的日子已经结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our riding days are over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.49,0:10:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你该休息的 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be resting, my dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.85,0:10:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我很好 罗伯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm fine, Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.00,0:10:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的 我很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.40,0:10:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道医生的叮嘱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what the doctor said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.11,0:11:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你比他还要大惊小怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fuss even more than he does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.09,0:11:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贾斯珀 真乖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jasper, good dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.42,0:11:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡丽 你今天怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how's Carrie today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.43,0:11:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好 谢谢 罗伯特爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, very well, thank you, Sir Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.49,0:11:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而在过去一周{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for the past week, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.56,0:11:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的马车依然驶过马厩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}her ladyship has driven past the stables{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.46,0:11:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却再也没有来打过招呼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with never so much as a good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.26,0:11:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为他们之间有了争执吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think there's been some sort of quarrel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.64,0:11:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是彼此怀恨 来势汹汹 剑拔弩张的一次争吵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a bitter, savage, spiteful quarrel at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.16,0:11:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 他都不会接近她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, he never goes near her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.03,0:11:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她几乎都不离开房间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She hardly leaves her room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.96,0:11:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了每天乘车出行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}except to take her daily drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.15,0:11:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你亲眼目睹了这场争论的发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I assume that you have witnessed such a disagreement?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.43,0:11:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no, not exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.40,0:11:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但否则为什么他要把她的宠物狗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why else would he give away{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.89,0:11:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}送走呢 福尔摩斯先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}her pet spaniel, Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.05,0:11:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她喜欢那只狗 视如己出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She loved that dog as if it were her child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.95,0:11:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能给出任何理由为什么罗伯特爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you think of any reason why Sir Robert{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.70,0:12:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要以这种方式令他的姐姐难过吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}would wish to upset his sister in this fashion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.86,0:12:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想不通{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}None at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.52,0:12:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样对待一位心脏脆弱的女士实在太残忍了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a cruel way to treat a woman with a weak heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.57,0:12:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}简直差劲透了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's damn rotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.24,0:12:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得说我并不认为他犯了什么罪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must say he does not appear to be committing any crime that I recognize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.66,0:12:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那为什么罗伯特爵士要在夜里离开宅子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why did Sir Robert leave the house at the dead of night, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.63,0:12:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他去见的人是谁呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and who was the man he met?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.66,0:12:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.06,0:12:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是管家斯蒂芬斯看到他出了门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it was Stephens, the butler, who saw him leave, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.36,0:12:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后告诉了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he told me about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.91,0:12:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以第二天夜里我们跟踪了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the next night we followed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.05,0:13:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.98,0:13:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}塞缪尔 布鲁尔？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samuel Brewer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.30,0:13:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当时太黑了 看不清他的脸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too dark to see his face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.68,0:13:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伯特爵士在什么时候送走了他姐姐的狗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did Sir Robert give away his sister's dog?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.07,0:13:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一周前的今天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A week ago today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.55,0:13:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贾斯珀在磨坊里鬼哭狼嚎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jasper was howling like a banshee at the mill house, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.21,0:13:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但身为主人也不该就这么送人呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that was no good reason for the master to do what he did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.46,0:13:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伯特爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.23,0:13:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要它离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want it offthis estate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.37,0:13:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不在乎你怎么处置它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what you do with it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.32,0:13:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要别再让我看到它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}just as long as I never have to see it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.17,0:13:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.41,0:13:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把狗给了桑迪贝恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave the dog to Sandy Bain, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.50,0:13:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一位骑师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the jockey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.33,0:13:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 贾斯珀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right then, Jasper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.03,0:14:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们去喝点东西吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's you and I go for a drink, hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.53,0:14:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.26,0:14:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第二天早上 他把狗给了乔赛亚 巴恩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next morning, he took it to Josiah Barnes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.54,0:14:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}柯伦德那儿的绿龙旅馆的老板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the landlord at the Green Dragon in Crendall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.98,0:14:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比阿特丽斯夫人有贴身伴侣吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does Lady Beatrice have a companion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.48,0:14:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有个女仆 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her maid, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.12,0:14:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有一个？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.04,0:14:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡丽 埃文斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carrie Evans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.19,0:14:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但她已经跟随夫人五年了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she's been with her this five years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.65,0:14:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那她很忠心了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And is no doubt devoted?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.98,0:14:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的确很忠心 不过我不能说是对谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is devoted enough, and I won't say to whom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.17,0:14:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.75,0:14:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能搬弄是非{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell tales out of school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.58,0:14:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伯特爵士挺会讨女人欢心的吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Robert is something of a lady's man, hey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.55,0:14:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不觉得姐弟间的不睦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you not think the quarrel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.98,0:14:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能是由此产生的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}between brother and sister may lie there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.04,0:14:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 这个流言早已是人尽皆知了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that scandal has been pretty clear for a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.12,0:14:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但比阿特丽斯夫人或许之前没有发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Lady Beatrice may not have seen it before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.93,0:14:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我们假设她突然知晓了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us suppose that she suddenly found it out, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.15,0:14:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}于是要辞退这个讨她厌的女仆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she wants to be rid of the hated maid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.52,0:14:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他不同意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will not permit it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.04,0:14:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}于是她拒绝跟他说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She refuses to speak to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.22,0:14:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而罗伯特爵士一怒之下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Sir Robert in his anger{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.96,0:14:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}送走了她的爱犬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}gives away her dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.44,0:14:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不止这些 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more to it than that, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.66,0:15:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅森先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Mason, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.18,0:15:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你比我们有优势{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have the advantage of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.45,0:15:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能还有些你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps there is something{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.25,0:15:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有告诉我们的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you have not told us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.20,0:15:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地下室里有个中央暖气锅炉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a central heating furnace in the cellar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.18,0:15:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经许久未用了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been off for some time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.91,0:15:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但罗伯特爵士抱怨天冷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Sir Robert complained of cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.01,0:15:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又把它烧了起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And had it on again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.97,0:15:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈维负责烧锅炉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harvey runs it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.83,0:15:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是我的一个伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's one of my lads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.80,0:15:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他感到不妙 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't like the look of it, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.87,0:15:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昨晚把这个交个了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he brought it to me last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.74,0:15:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈维多久烧一次炉子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How often does Harvey attend the furnace?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.63,0:15:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他每晚把炉子烧起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He makes it up every evening, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.28,0:15:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后就离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then he leaves it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.55,0:15:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么有人能在晚上出入那里吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So anyone can visit it during the night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.46,0:15:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.24,0:16:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但伙计拿着大门的钥匙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the lad has the key to the outer door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.54,0:16:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.63,0:16:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你提到的那个旅店叫什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is the name of that tavern you spoke of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.94,0:16:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绿龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Green Dragon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.34,0:16:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在帕克郡有不错的钓鱼点吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there any good fishing in that part of Parkshire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.68,0:16:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}河沟里有鲑鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's trout in the millstream{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.49,0:16:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}湖里有梭子鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and pike in the lake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.51,0:16:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经够好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.11,0:16:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为这是什么 华生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you make of it, Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.99,0:16:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是大腿的上髁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the upper contour of a femur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.27,0:16:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人骨吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.16,0:16:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毫无疑问{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without a doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.20,0:16:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是在唬人 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a bluff, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.46,0:16:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能是任何人寄来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone could have sent it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.03,0:16:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许是个马探子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could be a tout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.02,0:16:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不在乎谁写的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care who it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.64,0:16:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要知道他所写的内容中 是否有属实的部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to know if there's any truth in what he's written.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.61,0:17:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我离开的期间 卡丽负责照顾家中事务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carrie will be in charge of the house while I'm away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.48,0:17:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡丽吗 先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carrie, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.23,0:17:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得把心思放在「王子」的训练上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your concern must be for the Prince's training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.11,0:17:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有再比那更重要的事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing is more important than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.51,0:17:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}五十三{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifty-three, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.59,0:17:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}五十四{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifty-four, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.55,0:17:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}五十五{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifty-five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.09,0:17:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有何吩咐 女士？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, ma'am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.28,0:17:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 斯蒂芬斯 把餐盘拿走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Stephens, please take the tray now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.55,0:17:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}五十六{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifty-six.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.72,0:17:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我黎明时出发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I leave at dawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.19,0:18:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两间房是吗 先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two room, is that right, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.67,0:18:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再要两杯你这儿最好的酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And two glasses of your best ale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.76,0:18:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.16,0:18:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 福尔摩斯 - 嗯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Holmes? - Hm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.13,0:18:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.32,0:19:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们 你们好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good day, gentlemen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.47,0:19:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好 老家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, old fellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.38,0:19:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 女士们 不好意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, ladies, I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.45,0:19:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我刚才没注意你们坐在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't see you sitting there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.77,0:19:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里真是寒风凛冽啊 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's quite a bite in the air, isn't there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.44,0:19:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想要更自由些吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you'd much rather be free, wouldn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.23,0:19:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Landlord!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.38,0:19:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难道一定要把这条狗栓得这么紧吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it really necessary to keep this dog tied up like this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.89,0:19:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生 如果不栓紧了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I didn't, sir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.60,0:19:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它一溜烟就会跑回原来的主人家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'd be off back to the owner in a jiffy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.25,0:19:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看 先生 贾斯珀是只肖斯科姆犬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, sir, Jasper's a Shoscombe spaniel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.86,0:19:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 我本该看出来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I should have known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.05,0:19:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瞧 我也是个爱狗之人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, I'm quite a dog enthusiast myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.98,0:19:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.02,0:19:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拿行李时小心点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful with that luggage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.48,0:19:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}否则我活剥了你的皮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I'll skin you alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.25,0:19:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请别放心里去 先生们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you mind him, sirs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.43,0:19:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他还要照顾他的母亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He takes after his mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.46,0:19:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是出来钓鱼的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out for a bit of fishing, hey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.20,0:19:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们想在霍尔湖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought we might try and land a pike or two{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.25,0:19:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}钓几条梭子鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the Hole Lake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.05,0:19:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没等你钓到鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might find yourselves in the lake{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.98,0:19:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你自己就先掉里头去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you were through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.61,0:19:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.68,0:19:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为罗伯特爵士极度警惕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Sir Robert is terrible jealous of anyone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.86,0:20:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怕有人监视他的马厩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who might be spying on his stables.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.94,0:20:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们又不是马探子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're not touts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.63,0:20:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是那种先斩后奏的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the sort that strikes first and speaks afterwards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.42,0:20:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 我们午餐前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson, I think we should take a little walk{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.62,0:20:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}出去走走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}before lunch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.59,0:20:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主意不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's a splendid idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.17,0:20:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老板 我们可以把狗带上吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think we could take the dog with us, Landlord?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.73,0:20:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然可以 先生们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By all means, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.10,0:20:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是记得我说的关于罗伯特爵士的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But mind what I said about Sir Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.59,0:20:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走这边 华生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's this way, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.17,0:20:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伯特爵士现在如何了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Sir Robert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.78,0:20:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据我估计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By my estimate, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.77,0:20:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他现在应该在去约克的路上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he should be well on his way to York by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.91,0:20:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么知道的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.75,0:21:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我给他发了封电报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I had a telegram sent to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.73,0:21:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 你有什么目的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes, what have you been up to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.28,0:21:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 帕尔默是最有希望获胜的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, Palmer's the Favorite{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.01,0:21:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就养在约克附近的马厩里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is stabled somewhere near York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.62,0:21:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是提示他那匹马{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I merely advised him that the horse has shown{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.88,0:21:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最近几天有了长足的进步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}much improvement in the last few days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.30,0:21:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当他发现自己被愚弄了可不会高兴的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't be pleased when he finds he's been duped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.54,0:21:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我确定他会气急败坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure he'll be furious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.34,0:21:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贾斯珀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jasper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.32,0:21:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贾斯珀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jasper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.77,0:21:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来啊 小伙 你好啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on boy, hello boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.40,0:21:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么样啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you aye, hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.95,0:21:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贾斯珀 这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jasper. Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.79,0:21:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认识你们吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I know you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.80,0:21:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 但显然贾斯珀认识你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but evidently, Jasper knows you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.84,0:21:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一定是桑迪贝恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be Sandy Bain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.06,0:21:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.30,0:21:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是你上周把贾斯珀送到旅店的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was you that brought Jasper to the tavern last week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.87,0:21:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.91,0:21:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你喜欢动物吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're fond of animals?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.27,0:21:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们都由上帝所造 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all God's creatures, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.05,0:21:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不愿看到它们受伤害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't see no harm come to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.16,0:21:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅森先生似乎认为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Mason seemed to think{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.34,0:21:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贾斯珀幸运的逃脱了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Jasper had a lucky escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.88,0:21:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他那么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must have had a reason{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.00,0:21:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定是有原因的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for behaving like he did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.15,0:21:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信罗伯特爵士的确有他的动机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure Sir Robert had the best of motives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.49,0:22:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我是说贾斯珀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm talking about Jasper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.90,0:22:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他一直很安静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's always such a quiet dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.42,0:22:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定是发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, something must have happened to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.57,0:22:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那磨坊里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the millhouse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.98,0:22:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.93,0:22:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地下室？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cellar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.91,0:22:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 先生 是在老教堂里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir, at the old church.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.03,0:22:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事情就发生在我把它送去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the same morning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.56,0:22:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绿龙旅店的那天早上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought him to the Green Dragon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.96,0:22:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是个破旧损毁的小礼拜堂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an old ruin chapel, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.27,0:22:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下面有个地下室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and under it there's a crypt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.40,0:22:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在本地声名并不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which has a bad name among us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.85,0:22:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贾斯珀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jasper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.24,0:22:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.26,0:22:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贾斯珀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jasper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.00,0:22:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贾斯珀 回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jasper, come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.66,0:22:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贾斯珀 回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jasper, come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.80,0:22:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贾斯珀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jasper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.22,0:22:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贾斯珀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jasper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.50,0:23:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贾斯珀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jasper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.87,0:23:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来啊 孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.22,0:23:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来啊 我可不是在玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. I'm not playing games now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.70,0:23:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贾斯珀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jasper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.96,0:24:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里离庄园有多远？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far are we away from the hall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.93,0:24:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大约四分之一英里 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}About a quarter of a mile, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.60,0:24:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比阿特丽斯夫人是在正午乘车出行吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm correct in thinking that Lady Beatrice takes a drive about midday?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.60,0:24:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.16,0:24:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 事不宜迟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, we've not a moment to lose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.95,0:24:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快走 贾斯珀 快走 华生 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come Jasper, come Watson, come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.30,0:25:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拦住马车 华生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop the carriage, Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.48,0:25:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拦住马车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}stop the carriage!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.52,0:25:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不好意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.72,0:25:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请问去镇上的绿龙该怎么走？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you direct us to the Green Dragon in town?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.94,0:25:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快走 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drive on, drive on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.92,0:25:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呆着 别过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay, stay back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.43,0:25:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.48,0:26:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在比阿特丽斯夫人明天再次乘车出行之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's nothing we can do{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.72,0:26:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们没什么能做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}until Lady Beatrice takes her drive again tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.27,0:26:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还没解释为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still haven't explained{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.24,0:26:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天午后要我那样冒险拦车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}why I risked my life this afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.05,0:26:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了验证一个推理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To test a theory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.87,0:26:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一定很失望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be very disappointed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.71,0:26:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没验证成功却害我差点丧命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was almost killed instead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.18,0:26:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相反 我想我的小实验很成功{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the contrary, I think my little experiment was quite successful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.24,0:26:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我怎么没看出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fail to see how.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.13,0:26:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那只狗 华生 狗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dog, Watson, the dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.05,0:26:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没想到什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did that suggest nothing to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.50,0:26:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡丽 埃文斯决意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Carrie Evans is determined{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.39,0:26:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要让狗和女主人不能相见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to keep the dog and her mistress apart so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.90,0:26:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有别的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is an alternative?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.99,0:26:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.18,0:26:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伯特爵士把那个放债人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Sir Robert has done away with{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.44,0:26:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}塞缪尔 布鲁尔做掉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the moneylender, Samuel Brewer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.06,0:26:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别忘了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.41,0:26:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别忘了发现的人骨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget the human bone that was found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.99,0:26:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没忘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't forgotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.14,0:26:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我来讲 显而易见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's perfectly clear to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.93,0:26:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们之前有过争执{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've crossed swords before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.89,0:26:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很可能这次罗伯特爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's possible that Sir Robert{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.43,0:26:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做得太过分了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}has gone too far this time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.60,0:26:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}犯了谋杀罪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and is guilty of murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.09,0:26:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个孩子发现的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the boy found{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.40,0:26:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正是那位不幸的放债人的遗体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is all that remains of the unfortunate moneylender.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.52,0:26:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 不 不 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.65,0:26:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我饿死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm famished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.09,0:27:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}新抓到的 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fresh catch, Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.57,0:27:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好久都没见到这么棒的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best I've seen in a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.26,0:27:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是「水深火热」啊 华生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are deep waters, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.53,0:27:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}水深火热 浊而不清{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deep and rather dirty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.54,0:27:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想借用地下室的钥匙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like to borrow the key to the cellar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.29,0:27:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}干什么用 福尔摩斯先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what purpose, Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.57,0:27:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了进门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To get inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.13,0:27:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伯特爵士在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Sir Robert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.40,0:27:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伯特爵士昨天一早{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Sir Robert left for York{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.28,0:27:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去约克了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}early yesterday morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.82,0:27:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今晚才能回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He isn't expected back till some time tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.58,0:27:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我本应带你四处看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd show you around the house myself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.59,0:27:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但主人走了 卡丽负责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but master left Carrie in charge, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.33,0:27:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她不会让任何人跨入大门一步的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she won't let anyone past the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.96,0:27:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他指派一个女仆掌管庄园？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left a maid in charge of the house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.48,0:27:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉过您 主人和夫人有过节{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you things were bad between master and her ladyship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.55,0:27:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比阿特丽斯夫人的房间在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whereabouts is Lady Beatrice's room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.77,0:27:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在一层 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's on the ground floor, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.98,0:27:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为她的心脏不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on account of her ladyship's heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.57,0:27:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}刚好在底层的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precisely on the ground floor where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.11,0:28:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走廊里第二间房{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second room in the corridor beside{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.65,0:28:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在地下室入口旁边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the cellar passageway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.77,0:28:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自从我们在贝克街的谈话之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has there been any change in the running of the house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.75,0:28:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}房子里的人事有什么变化吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}since we spoke at Baker Street?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.77,0:28:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没想到有什么 除了我得解雇哈维{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}None that I can think of, apart from the fact that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.41,0:28:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的一个伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to dismiss Harvey, one of my stable lads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.57,0:28:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他就那个在炉子里发现骨头的人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't he the one that found the bone in the furnace?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.17,0:28:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.92,0:28:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么要解雇他？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is the reason for his dismissal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.65,0:28:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他偷了这里某个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he'd stolen some money{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.85,0:28:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雇员的钱 所以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from somebody on the staff and so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.55,0:28:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 这就是「王子」 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, here's the Prince himself, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.32,0:28:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全身都闪耀着冠军的光芒 你说呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every inch a champion, wouldn't you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.26,0:28:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 非常出色的生灵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he's a very fine creature, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.27,0:28:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你才是专家 华生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're the expert, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.21,0:28:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根本不是什么专家 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardly an expert, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.67,0:28:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我刚刚看到「王子」在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am aware of the Prince's bursts of speed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.93,0:28:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最后一弗隆的爆发力 但问题是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}over a final furlong but the fact is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.17,0:28:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它没有在大赛上赢过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he hasn't yet won a major race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.02,0:28:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是否依然认为它有很大胜算？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think he's still in with a good chance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.36,0:28:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果它已经充分准备 那么是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's given the ground, then yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.00,0:29:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 好吧 等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right, hold your horses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.33,0:29:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来了 我来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming, I'm coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.46,0:29:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下午好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.30,0:29:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一定是斯蒂芬斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be Stephens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.74,0:29:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.75,0:29:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是位医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.63,0:29:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伯特爵士让我一有时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Sir Robert asked me to call on his sister{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.04,0:29:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就来拜访他的姐姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the first opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.99,0:29:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我刚到此地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm new to the area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.94,0:29:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他没跟我说过 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he said nothing about it to me, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.05,0:29:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他肯定是忘了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he must have forgotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.46,0:29:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对于罗伯特爵士这样的大忙人来说一点不奇怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardly surprising for a man as busy as Sir Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.41,0:29:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕夫人现在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid her ladyship is out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.88,0:30:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在外面乘车兜风呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}taking her carriage exercise at the moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.18,0:30:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多长时间能回来呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long is she likely to be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.58,0:30:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不超过半小时 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no more than half an hour, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.01,0:30:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那这样的话 我不介意等着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, in that case I don't mind waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.93,0:30:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看起来你也有病痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You appear to be in some pain yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.69,0:30:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是风湿病 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's the rheumatics, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.35,0:30:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这把老骨头曾经{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These old bones have taken a pounding{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.22,0:30:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}受过伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in their time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.09,0:30:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}健康状况大不如前啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Health's not what it was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.91,0:30:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么不跟我说说呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, why don't you tell me about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.10,0:30:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您的意思是？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beg pardon, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.61,0:30:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然我在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now that I'm here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.54,0:30:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那不如看看我能帮上什么忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might as well make myself useful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.78,0:30:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 你人真好 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's very kind of you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.26,0:30:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.90,0:30:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是从我的手腕末端开始的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it starts in the bottom of my wrist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.05,0:30:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后逐渐向上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then it goes up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.78,0:30:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到肩膀？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your shoulder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.92,0:31:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「S.B.」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}S.B.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.47,0:32:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 早晨一起床时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, the worst time is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.49,0:32:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最难熬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}first thing in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.55,0:32:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的脖子和胳膊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My back and my legs, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.67,0:32:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 跟木板一样僵硬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, stiff as a board.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.89,0:32:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有我的脚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my feet, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.14,0:32:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我跟你说过我的脚吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}did I tell you about my feet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.73,0:32:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.86,0:32:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 我得跟你说说我的脚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'll tell you about my feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.11,0:32:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}冰块 就像冰块{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blocks of ice, like blocks of ice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.84,0:32:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有时我都感觉不到脚的存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't feel them sometimes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.55,0:32:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的血液循环不顺畅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your blood's not circulating properly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.64,0:32:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是个常见问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a common problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.55,0:32:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有另外一个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then there's the other trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.35,0:32:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另外一个问题？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other trouble?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.21,0:32:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道的 另外一个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the other trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.91,0:34:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我试过各种方法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've tried everything, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.28,0:34:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但都根本没什么起色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it doesn't make any difference at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.16,0:34:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和以前一样痛苦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in just as much agony now as I ever was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.64,0:34:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}袖子卷起来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roll it right up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.30,0:34:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 那是夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that'll be her ladyship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.17,0:34:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她回来早了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's back early.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.62,0:34:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉 不过恐怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please excuse me, but I'm afraid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.08,0:34:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还有另一个紧急的门诊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have another urgent appointment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.47,0:35:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快到了 夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost there, my lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.05,0:35:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 斯蒂芬斯 这就可以了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Stephens, we'll be all right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.32,0:35:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 斯蒂芬斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Stephens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.61,0:35:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right you are, Miss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.29,0:35:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奇怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.59,0:35:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 谢天谢地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes, thank goodness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.32,0:35:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}幸亏卧室在底层{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortunately, the bedroom is on the ground floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.27,0:36:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么新发现吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you have any luck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.50,0:36:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一些事情还不明朗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few things are still unclear, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.27,0:36:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but before the night is out, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.15,0:36:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在天明之前解决{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope to have solved the mystery{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.86,0:36:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肖斯科姆别墅的谜题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Shoscombe Old Place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.18,0:36:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}假设塞缪尔 布鲁尔再来庄园要钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Samuel Brewer returned to the hall to demand his money, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.52,0:36:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他可能会在晚上来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he might have done so at night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.02,0:36:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能就是罗伯特爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could have been the man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.74,0:36:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在老教堂所见的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Sir Robert met at the old church.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.55,0:36:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能罗伯特爵士大发雷霆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps Sir Robert flew into one of his rages{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.40,0:36:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并杀了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and killed him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.57,0:36:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在惊慌失措中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in a moment of sheer panic{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.75,0:36:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把他丢进炉子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}tried to dispose of the body{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.62,0:36:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以处理尸体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by putting it into the furnace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.42,0:36:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此 这个钱包{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hence, the note case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.48,0:36:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson, the vibrations!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.27,0:36:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许我得承认{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If perhaps maybe I admit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.56,0:36:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们现在掌握的都是间接证据{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the evidence we have so far is purely circumstantial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.77,0:37:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.10,0:37:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}松香{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Resin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.61,0:37:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}松香？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Resin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.27,0:37:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}含有酒精成分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On an alcohol base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.60,0:37:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是在比阿特丽斯夫人的房间里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traces of it on a few strands of hair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.15,0:37:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找到的几根头发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}found in Lady Beatrice's room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.44,0:37:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来 华生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.60,0:37:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}电报可不会让{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The telegram will not{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.55,0:37:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伯特在那儿呆很久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}keep Sir Robert away much longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.57,0:37:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要去哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.38,0:38:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伯特爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.97,0:38:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不在的时候发生了什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened while I was away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.30,0:38:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么事 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.02,0:38:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别骗我 梅森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't lie to me, Mason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.49,0:38:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人在背着我干一些事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's been going on behind my back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.67,0:38:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是不是有人在这附近盘问？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has anyone been around here asking questions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.88,0:38:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有人 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.10,0:38:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我在柯伦德附近遇到一些人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apart from some people I met near Crendall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.25,0:38:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道他们的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know their names.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.01,0:38:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们说了些什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you talk about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.88,0:38:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.83,0:38:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们对老教堂很感兴趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were interested in the old church.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.69,0:38:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fool!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.04,0:39:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果塞缪尔 布鲁尔不是受害者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if Samuel Brewer was not the victim, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.18,0:39:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那为什么他的钱包{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}why was his note case found{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.09,0:39:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会在庄园的地下室里找到呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the cellar of the hall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.77,0:39:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里还有谁的名字是以S.B.开头的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who else in the household has the initials S. B?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.06,0:39:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}SB，SB{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}S.B., S.B.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.96,0:39:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}桑迪贝恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sandy Bain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.25,0:39:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈维因为偷了别人的钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harvey was dismissed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.52,0:39:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而被逐出了房子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for stealing from other members of the household.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.34,0:39:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的职责之一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of his duties{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.34,0:39:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是照看地下室的炉子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was to tend to the furnace in the cellar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.59,0:39:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实上的确有尸体被烧了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the fact remains that the body was burned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.99,0:39:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果那不是布鲁尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it wasn't Brewer's, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.43,0:39:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又会是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then whose was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.13,0:40:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.27,0:41:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这样一个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could you possibly be able to find{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.86,0:41:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能找到什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a place like this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.54,0:41:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}铅衬被切掉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lead lining's been cut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.50,0:41:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不出我所料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as I thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.93,0:41:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}螺钉松了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bolts have been loosened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.70,0:41:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 我需要你帮忙把这个打开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson, I'm going to need your help to open this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.93,0:41:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 这是亵渎神明啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes, that's desecration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.14,0:42:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.26,0:42:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你动我的东西干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing on my property?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.47,0:42:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听见没有？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.04,0:42:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.06,0:42:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在这儿干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.57,0:42:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.08,0:43:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.00,0:43:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发生了什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.68,0:43:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}问得好 梅森先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A good question, Mr. Mason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.66,0:43:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}问题直指罗伯特爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One that should be directed at Sir Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.45,0:43:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 该死的装置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, blasted contraptions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.73,0:43:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么敢？出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare you? Get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.45,0:43:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我本想跟你们一起喝茶的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was going to join you for tea, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.44,0:43:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我好像来晚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I see I'm too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.48,0:43:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马上出去 否则我就叫罗伯特爵士了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out this instant or I'll call for Sir Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.27,0:43:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伯特爵士知道我在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Robert knows that I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.57,0:43:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}埃文斯小姐 请坐下好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Miss Evans, will you sit down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.33,0:43:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想如果不来向比阿特丽斯致敬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt I couldn't visit Shoscombe Old Place{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.69,0:43:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就不能拜访肖斯科姆别墅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}without paying my respects to Lady Beatrice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.61,0:43:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 你们喝茶的时候还喝白兰地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you have brandy with your tea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.03,0:43:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然是用来治疗的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For medicinal purposes, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.93,0:43:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这是不是足以让我好奇？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But is it enough I wonder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.03,0:43:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好奇什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough for what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.54,0:43:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}白兰地是用来恢复精神的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brandy revives the spirits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.95,0:43:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不认为这足够{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hardly think it is sufficient{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.98,0:44:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用来唤醒死人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to raise the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.52,0:44:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别动 埃文斯小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move, Miss. Evans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.76,0:44:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样你就好受多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should be comfortable enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.34,0:44:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等你自己的医生来吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}until your own doctor arrives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.10,0:44:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.60,0:44:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是夏洛克 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.20,0:45:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许你对我的名字很熟悉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps my name is familiar to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.42,0:45:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许表面看来并非如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know appearances are against me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.32,0:45:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你必须相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you must believe that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.92,0:45:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我别无选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could act in no other way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.37,0:45:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很高兴你这样说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very happy to hear you say so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.23,0:45:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我恐怕你得跟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I fear your explanations{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.60,0:45:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警察解释这些了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}must be for the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.72,0:45:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求你了 罗伯特爵士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Sir Robert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.42,0:45:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些行为的一切责任都由我一人承担{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The responsibility for what has been done is entirely mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.98,0:45:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}埃文斯小姐和乔伊·巴恩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Evans and Joe Barnes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.75,0:45:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是听从我的指示{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}were merely following my instructions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.99,0:45:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你必须保证他们不受伤害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must promise that they will come to no harm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.52,0:45:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我无法跟你保证任何事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can promise you nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.11,0:45:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我愿意听一听事情的真相{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I will hear a plain statement of the facts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.99,0:45:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.18,0:45:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}显然你对我的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've clearly gone pretty deeply{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.73,0:45:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经了如指掌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}into my affairs, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.85,0:45:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}否则我不会在那儿碰到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}otherwise I should not have found you where I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.40,0:45:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我始终清楚如果比阿特丽斯去世{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always known that if Beatrice died, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.43,0:45:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地产将归由{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the estate would revert{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.19,0:45:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我姐夫的家人所有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to my brother-in-law's family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.30,0:45:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有东西都会被查封{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything would be seized, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.45,0:45:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}包括我的马厩和马匹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}including the stables and the horses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.52,0:45:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.90,0:45:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我姐姐一周前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}my sister did die, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.28,0:46:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确去世了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}just a week ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.44,0:46:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而你没告诉任何人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you told no one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.54,0:46:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没有多少选择余地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had little alternative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.53,0:46:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我公之于众 我将面对全面的破产{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I told the truth, I faced absolute ruin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.52,0:46:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我延迟到比赛之后公开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if I could stave things off until the race, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.90,0:46:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道一切都会好转{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew all might be well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.45,0:46:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比阿特丽斯死于长期困扰她的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beatrice died of the heart condition{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.95,0:46:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}心脏问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that had long afflicted her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.54,0:46:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这一点要由验尸官来确认{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That will be for a coroner to decide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.70,0:46:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的医生可以证明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her own doctor would certify that for months, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.86,0:46:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}数月以来她的症状预示了这个结局{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}her symptoms had threatened such an end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.12,0:46:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乔伊·巴恩斯在比阿特丽斯去世前一两天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe Barnes came to see me in search of work{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.76,0:46:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到我这里找工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a day or two before Beatrice died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.05,0:46:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他看起来是个值得信赖的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seemed a trustworthy lad, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.06,0:46:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我想到让他来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it came into my mind that he might{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.03,0:46:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}假扮我亲爱的姐姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a short time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.37,0:46:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一段时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}impersonate my dear sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.68,0:46:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要「她」每天出现在马车上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was but a case of appearing daily in her carriage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.41,0:46:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为没人会进她的房间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for no one need enter her room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.94,0:46:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了埃文斯小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}save Miss. Evans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.26,0:46:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 我很信任她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, I had to take her into my confidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.03,0:46:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}整个骗局让我也很痛苦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole deception distressed me greatly, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.61,0:47:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但想不到其他办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I could see no other course to take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.14,0:47:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很自然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naturally, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.76,0:47:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尸体不能存放在卧室里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the body couldn't remain in the bedroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.53,0:47:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第一天晚上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the first night, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.76,0:47:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乔伊和我把尸体抬出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe and I carried it out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.36,0:47:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放到老磨坊里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the old mill house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.66,0:47:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的宠物狗跟着我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were followed by her pet spaniel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.43,0:47:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且之后它一直在门口狂吠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which afterwards howled continually at the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.91,0:47:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我觉得应该找个更安全的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I felt some safer place was needed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.29,0:47:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我赶走了狗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got rid of the dog, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.03,0:47:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们把比阿特丽斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we carried Beatrice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.72,0:47:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抬到教堂的地下室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the crypt of the church.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.11,0:47:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认为我们把她放在她丈夫的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seemed to me to be no unworthy resting place{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.47,0:47:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一位先人的棺材中作为其安息之所{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we put her for a time in the coffin{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.86,0:47:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并没有什么不妥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of one of her husband's ancestors{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.78,0:47:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她仍身处神圣之地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lying in what is still consecrated ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.09,0:47:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我每天都去向她致意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I paid my respects to her there every day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.92,0:48:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至于我们从棺材中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As to the old relics{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.30,0:48:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}取出的遗体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which we took from the coffin, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.37,0:48:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乔伊和我把它移走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe and I removed them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.55,0:48:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他晚上走出卧室并下楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He descended from the bedroom at night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.04,0:48:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在炉子里焚烧遗体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and burned them in the furnace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.50,0:49:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}设计这么的复杂的诡计真的有必要吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it necessarily to lay that monstrous trap?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.08,0:49:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认为没人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was determined that no one{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.63,0:49:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以打扰我姐姐安息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}should disturb my sister's rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.09,0:49:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你是怎么开始怀疑她的死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how you suspected her death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.71,0:49:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot imagine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.22,0:49:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是这样 昨天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yesterday, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.99,0:49:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当埃文斯小姐命令马车夫开走时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when Miss. Evans ordered the carriage to drive on, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.82,0:49:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我推断她是在害怕什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I concluded that she was afraid of something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.61,0:49:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我怀疑她怕的正是贾斯珀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suspected that something was Jasper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.89,0:49:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}埃文斯小姐知道狗不会出错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss. Evans knew that dogs do not make mistakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.40,0:49:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它会认出那不是它的女主人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would have known that it wasn't his mistress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.82,0:49:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们必须把此事交由警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we must leave all this for the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.71,0:49:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.07,0:49:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只需要一两天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A day or two is all I need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.09,0:49:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求你保持沉默吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say nothing yet I beg of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.95,0:49:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要比赛开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The race will have been run, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.75,0:49:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的噩梦就将结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my nightmare might be over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.40,0:49:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我全身心地爱着比阿特丽斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I loved Beatrice with all my heart, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.63,0:49:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其中没有任何污辱或不敬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there was no indignity or irreverence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.58,0:49:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不觉得我污辱了死者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't feel I have wronged the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.11,0:49:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道我的动机很自私{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I realize that my motives were selfish, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.09,0:50:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我姐姐是不会希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but my sister would not have wished{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.53,0:50:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看到我破产的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see me destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.75,0:50:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这并不意味着你有权违反法律{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That does not entitle you to break the law.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.60,0:50:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听听这个 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to this, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.92,0:50:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在「肖斯科姆王子」昨日夺得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Following the success of Shoscombe Prince{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.60,0:50:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}冠军锦标赛的冠军之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in yesterday's Champion Stakes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.62,0:50:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伯特爵士得到了足够丰厚的奖金{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir Robert has received sufficient winnings{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.76,0:50:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}偿还了所有债务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to settle all his debts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.81,0:50:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并足够他重新过上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with enough left to reestablish him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.27,0:50:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}优越的生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a fair position in life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.21,0:50:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.61,0:50:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然而 罗伯特爵士姐姐的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, the victory was marred{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.29,0:50:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}突然去世{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the sudden death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.07,0:50:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}冲淡了胜利的喜悦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Sir Robert's sister, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.56,0:50:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比阿特丽斯 福德夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Beatrice Folder{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.69,0:50:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少与他一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}whose love of horses{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.14,0:50:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}热爱赛马{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was at least as great as his own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.86,0:51:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至是避难在外的塞缪尔 布鲁尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the elusive Samuel Brewer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.02,0:51:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也从其法国的避难所归来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}has returned from his hideaway in France{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.87,0:51:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并发电报祝贺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to send a telegram of congratulations{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.11,0:51:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗伯特爵士的胜利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Sir Robert on his win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.97,0:51:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这表明债权人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It transpires that even creditors{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.07,0:51:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也还有自己的债权人啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}have their creditors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.10,0:51:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这解释了为什么塞缪尔 布鲁尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It explains why Samuel Brewer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.39,0:51:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么急于要回自己的钱财{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was so anxious to get his money back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.36,0:51:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但发电报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to send a telegram, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.33,0:51:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是赤裸裸的伪善{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}such a bare faced hypocrisy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.11,0:51:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你靠「肖斯科姆王子」赢了多少钱？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how much did you win on Shoscombe Prince?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.74,0:51:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}20吉尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty guineas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.96,0:51:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真可耻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's disgraceful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.89,0:51:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}香槟 哈德森太太？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Champagne, Mrs. Hudson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.85,0:51:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然了 正合时宜啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, in the circumstances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.36,0:51:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 你真好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's very good of you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.57,0:51:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我只赢了20吉尼啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I've only won 20 guineas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.36,0:51:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再加上我的10吉尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus my ten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.66,0:51:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可不是唯一一个欲罢不能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the only one that likes a plunge{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.22,0:51:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一次次去赌马的家伙 医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the horses from time to time, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.29,0:51:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 哈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, gee.{\r}
